00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:40.240
if you're not able to refinance or sell

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.919
by the time the balloon payment is due?

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.360
Well, it's due. And if you don't pay it,

00:19:41.919 --> 00:19:46.160
then they're going to get the asset back

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:48.000
in most cases, unless you're extra savvy

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.520
and that's not worked into the contract,

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:51.679
which is not likely. They're probably

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:53.360
going to be in first lean position on

00:19:51.679 --> 00:19:54.880
the asset, which means they are the

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:56.559
first person in line to get it back

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:58.799
should you default on those payments.

00:19:56.559 --> 00:20:00.960
Okay. The next structure, interestonly

00:19:58.799 --> 00:20:02.960
payments. That's it is what it sounds

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:04.320
