00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:06.080
the principal, you're just paying

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:07.520
interest for a set amount of time. Now,

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.520
this is great because if you're in a

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:11.440
tighter cash flow business, you're not

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:13.280
