00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:20.960
works very similarly to the balloon

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.880
payment that I just referenced because

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:25.200
at a certain point that note is going to

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:27.120
be due. Now, the third structure I

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.280
really like as part of seller financing

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.640
